@startuml
title Key Determination & Strategy Flow (ReasonTouch)

actor User as U

participant "ManualWorkspace" as MW
participant "ProgressionGenerationRequest" as PGR
participant "ProgressionAnalysis" as PA
participant "ChordSuggestionEngine" as CSE
participant "PairingEngine" as PE
participant "Strategy (Lift/Resolve/Contrast/Continue)" as STRAT
participant "GeneratedProgression" as GP

== User Input ==

U -> MW : Select chords manually\n(e.g., C, G, Bdim, C)
MW -> PGR : Build ProgressionGenerationRequest\nwith raw chord list

== Key Inference ==

PGR -> PA : Analyze progression\n(determine key, functions, cadence,\nstability, tension)
PA --> PGR : Return analysis\n(key inferred here)

note right of PA
KEY IS DETERMINED HERE
- scale-degree mapping
- functional roles (TONIC/PD/DOM)
- cadence classification
- stability & tension
end note

== Strategy Routing ==

PGR -> PE : Request strategy selection\n(using stability + tension)
PE --> STRAT : Select strategy\n(e.g., LiftStrategy)

note right of PE
PairingEngine does NOT determine key.
It only consumes the key-aware analysis.
end note

== Phrase Generation ==

loop For each chord in continuation
    STRAT -> CSE : suggest(key, lastChord)\n(key passed implicitly)
    CSE --> STRAT : diatonic pool + ranked suggestions
    STRAT -> STRAT : filter by function\n(DOM/PD/TONIC)
    STRAT -> STRAT : choose chord\n(variantIndex, unused pool)
end loop

STRAT --> GP : Build GeneratedProgression\n(chords + confidence + explanation)

== Output ==

GP --> U : Display generated phrase\n(key-aware continuation)

@enduml

